OL,3,GNEWSAJunction improvement works to
OL,4,A'ease traffic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew safety measures have been installed
OL,7,Fat a junction as part of a #2.9m
OL,8,Finvestment programme.
OL,10,FDurham County Council has completed an
OL,11,Fimprovement scheme at St John's Road
OL,12,FJunction in Meadowfield, which it said
OL,13,Fwill ease traffic and boost safety.
OL,15,FThe works included new signals to ease
OL,16,Ftraffic turning right from the junction
OL,17,Fonto the A690 and new crossing
OL,18,Ffacilities to improve safety and
OL,19,Faccessibility for pedestrians, cyclists
OL,20,Fand wheelchair and scooter users
OL,21,Ftravelling to and from Meadowfield
OL,22,FIndustrial Estate.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
