OL,3,GNEWSAJunction improvement works to
OL,4,A'ease traffic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCabinet member for transport, Tim
OL,7,FMcGuinness, said the improvements
OL,8,Foffered "better connectivity" for the
OL,9,Farea and supported more sustainable
OL,10,Ftravel choices.
